# Earthion (PPSA28061): leave the intro and reach the title screen / main menu.
#
# Timing is anchored to the game's FIRST PAD POLL, not process start.
#
# Why it alternates Cross and Options rather than pressing one at a fixed offset: the intro is a
# story-text sequence whose page timing moves with the rendering policy, and which button leaves it
# was not known when this route was written. Alternating covers both and costs nothing -- surplus
# presses land in the menu as selection/back and the route returns to it, so every arm of an A/B
# sees the same states. Verify with PROSPER_PAD_SCRIPT_LOG=1, which prints the states the guest
# actually read.
#
# Reaches, under full-resolution `screenshot` capture on Linux/RADV: the title screen and main menu
# (logo, 'How to Play / Game Version / Reset / Audio / Visuals / Language / Extras'), and the HOW TO
# PLAY page. See README.md for the measured interior content metrics.
